          "gp": 75
        }
      },
      "bulk": "light",
      "usage": {
        "type": "worn",
        "slot": "garment"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "019ee6e3-c4fb-59ee-a517-80f8e1080ac2",
    "pack": "rival-academies",
    "kind": "equipment",
    "slug": "equipment:illusory-backdrop",
    "name": "Illusory Backdrop",
    "level": 10,
    "rarity": "rare",
    "traits": ["illusion", "magical", "structure"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "rival-academies",
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=3530",
        "page": 56
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This three-panel folding backdrop measures 5 feet tall and 3 feet wide and takes 2 hands to carry when folded up. It projects a preset illusion when fully unfolded. Illusory backdrops are typically used by artists, bards, gallery owners, and the occasional politician, and common illusions include the tops of battlements with grand castles in the background, cozy bowers, and well-appointed rooms."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Activate—Set the Scene",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " 1 minute (manipulate)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Effect",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You unfold the illusory backdrop, placing it on the edge of three contiguous 5-foot squares in a straight line. The illusion then emanates in a "
          },
          {
            "type": "template",
            "shape": "cone",
            "size": 15
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " from the center of the line, facing straight away from the panel. The illusion contains a scene that includes up to 5 discrete objects (usually foliage or pieces of furniture). The scene is static and lasts for 1 hour, though that duration restarts if the backdrop is refolded and then unfolded again. The appearance of the illusion is determined when the illusory backdrop is crafted and can't be changed."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.66OFeQOV6HM29j5R"
    },
    "data": {
      "price": {
        "coins": {
          "gp": 900
        }
      },
      "bulk": 3,
      "usage": {
        "type": "carried"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "d1d42d6b-1009-5792-8b17-50ff5d27114b",
    "pack": "rival-academies",
    "kind": "equipment",
    "slug": "equipment:inspiring-spotlight-mounted",
    "name": "Inspiring Spotlight (Mounted)",
    "level": 15,
    "rarity": "rare",
    "traits": ["light", "magical"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "rival-academies",
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=3531",
        "page": 56
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "An "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "inspiring spotlight",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " consists of a drum-shaped metal housing around several reflective plates. It has the capacity to cast a powerful, narrow beam of light to illuminate important moments or characters on stage. The portable version consists of an 18-inch-diameter lamp on a tripod that can be set up or broken down over the course of 10 minutes. The mounted version is typically 3 feet in diameter and affixed to a bracket above and behind the audience for indoor performances."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Activate—Light It Up",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " "
          },
          {
            "type": "action-cost",
            "cost": "one"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " (light, manipulate)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Frequency",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " once per hour"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Effect",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The inspiring spotlight emits a "
          },
          {
            "type": "template",
            "shape": "burst",
            "size": 5
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " of bright magical light within 240 feet. If the burst intersects with an area of magical darkness, the inspiring spotlight attempts to counteract the darkness with a +25 modifier. Creatures within the burst gain a +2 item bonus to saving throws and Charisma-based skill checks. The spotlight remains lit for 1 minute or until you Interact to turn it off. During this time any creature adjacent to the spotlight can move the burst up to 20 feet from the burst's original position with an Interact action."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.uTPqImeDq7bEsFak"
    },
    "data": {
      "price": {
        "coins": {
          "gp": 650
        }
      },
      "bulk": 8,
      "activations": [
        {
          "slug": "light-it-up",
          "name": "Light It Up",
          "frequency": {
            "max": 1,
            "per": "hour"
          }
        }
      ],
      "usage": {
        "type": "held",
        "hands": "one"
      }
    }
  },
