          "gp": 50
        }
      },
      "bulk": "negligible",
      "usage": {
        "type": "held",
        "hands": "one"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "3e3f4a60-a51a-583e-95e6-532d9d99268e",
    "pack": "rival-academies",
    "kind": "equipment",
    "slug": "equipment:weapon-of-false-wounds",
    "name": "Weapon of False Wounds",
    "level": 3,
    "rarity": "uncommon",
    "traits": ["illusion", "magical", "visual"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "rival-academies",
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=3536",
        "page": 57
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "These weapons consist mostly of illusions, except in the spots where the weapon would be held. A sword, for example, would consist only of a physical handle with the permanent illusion of a blade. "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Weapons of false wounds",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " come in all shapes and sizes to help accurately reenact both historic and theatrical combat without risk of injury. The most amazing property of these items is the fact the illusions become partially physical when interacting with other "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "weapons of false wounds",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", allowing blades to clash and parry as they would in actual combat. As a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "weapon of false wounds",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is designed specifically to interact with other illusions, paying attention to subtle changes in the weapon's appearance can help alert the wielder to nearby illusions. While using this item, you gain a +1 item bonus to Perception checks to disbelieve an illusion."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "key": "RollOption",
        "domain": "perception",
        "option": "option:weapon-of-false-wounds",
        "toggleable": true
      },
      {
        "key": "FlatModifier",
        "selectors": ["perception"],
        "type": "item",
        "value": 1,
        "predicate": ["option:weapon-of-false-illusions"]
      }
    ],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.JKrqKeBxSlLjF8xU"
    },
    "data": {
      "price": {
        "coins": {
          "gp": 80
        }
      },
      "bulk": "light"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "72e2c97f-52e1-5b85-a61e-6947221064bc",
    "pack": "rival-academies",
    "kind": "equipment",
    "slug": "equipment:windborne-platform",
    "name": "Windborne Platform",
    "level": 8,
    "rarity": "uncommon",
    "traits": ["air", "magical"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "rival-academies",
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=3537",
        "page": 57
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "These magical platforms are used in a variety of performances. They allow performers to access high places safely, while also serving an important role before the performance even begins. They're used by various backstage crews to hang lights, curtains, and scenery above the stage. Sometimes several of these platforms are lined up to make an upper and lower stage. This large 10-foot-by-10-foot platform can be secured to a surface as a 1-minute activity. While standing on a secured platform, any creature can use the Adjust Height activation."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Activate—Adjust Height",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " "
          },
          {
            "type": "action-cost",
            "cost": "one"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " (manipulate)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Effect",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The platform and all creatures and items on the platform either rise or lower up to 10 feet. This action fails if there is more than 50 Bulk on the platform."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.p0FkKcdjtQjAgEAM"
    },
